<div class="row mt-5 service-section-block">
    <div class="col-md-10 offset-md-1">
        <div class="frame-service-desc" style="height: auto;">
            <h3>Conferences & Meetings</h3>
            <p class="frame-service-text">
                Now you’d agree that like most things in life, a conference always has an objective – increased attendance, better customer satisfaction, drive brand devotion, introducing new ideas, fuelling new targets, authentic connections and all rounded up in a beautiful sequence of memorable moments. Hence the very reason for it to be planned well and designed catering to the goal. Ours are simpler – help you evolve through your events, drive your attendees and ultimately, elevate your brand.<br /><br />
                This requires a larger framework of operations at the back end which we have created in all our years of event and hospitality journey. The best hotels, exclusively trained on-ground team and an experienced lot of planners – all these add to the execution of precise, targeted conferences and meetings within the agreed budget. <br /><br />
                The size of the audience doesn’t matter to us. Just the impact got to be right. An all-day conference or an evening event for you folks at work, make a wish. We got your back.
            </p>
